@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
title Plan Ticket/Slice Loop - Implement, Validate, Diagnose and Re-plan

state "Select next dependency-ready Ticket/Slice\nRead Plan + Ticket + shared branch evidence" as select
state "Define Slice contract\nGoal / exclusions / ownership / dependencies\nAcceptance / concrete cases / validation command\nLevel: minimal / focused / regression / full" as contract
state "Minimal implementation\nTest-first when useful; bounded delegation optional\nKeep all Tickets/Slices on the Plan branch" as implement
state "Run selected focused checks\nCapture real exit status + failure evidence" as test
state "Classify failure\nDo not weaken assertions or retry blindly" as diagnose #FFF4CC
state "Fix implementation or test defect\nOnly evidence-backed, in-scope changes" as fix
state "Environment / dependency blocked\nPlan/Ticket Issue open; Status: blocked\nRecord cause + exact resume point" as blocked #FFF4CC
state "Re-plan Ticket / Slice\nUpdate boundaries, dependencies and acceptance\nPreserve completed valid work; stop widening patch" as replan
state "Slice validated\nRecord concise evidence in authoritative Ticket\nTicket is not done until Plan merge" as slice_done #DCFCE7
state "Plan acceptance + integration checks\nEscalate test level only for evidenced risk" as integrate
state "Plan ready for one PR\nContinue to Plan PR review loop" as ready #DCFCE7

[*] --> select
select --> contract : next Slice
contract --> implement
implement --> test
test --> slice_done : acceptance satisfied
test --> diagnose : failure / missing evidence
diagnose --> fix : implementation or test defect
fix --> test : rerun affected checks
diagnose --> blocked : external cause
blocked --> select : cause resolved; revalidate context\nStatus: in_progress
diagnose --> replan : requirement/design conflict\nor out-of-scope correction needed
implement --> replan : incorrect design assumption exposed
replan --> select : updated plan persisted; dependencies ready
slice_done --> select : more Slices
slice_done --> integrate : all Slices validated
integrate --> ready : Ticket acceptance passes
integrate --> diagnose : integration regression / gap\nidentify affected Slice
ready --> [*]

note right of select
Slice execution and Plan delivery are different loops.
Do not commit unrelated changes or start dependent Slices early.
Optional parallel work requires disjoint ownership;
main agent integrates and makes the final judgment.
end note
note right of test
Task commands use available native tools.
Tests / raw evidence preserve real output and exit status.
Passing focused checks do not trigger a full suite by default.
end note
@enduml
